5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello everyone. I am Misaki. I will try to stay calm and observe the discussion closely.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Hi. I'm Daisuke. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to listen and help.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Asuka here. I have a specific role. I will provide logical analysis based on my findings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Ryuji. I prefer to assess the situation before acting. I will remain cautious and observe.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
