11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with Misaki. Asuka, please guide us. I don't want to make a mistake.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I will not reveal my role yet. I need to gather more information before making a judgment.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
