16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I feel the same way. I'm scared of being wrong, so I'll follow the group's lead.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,Fear is a bad advisor. Logic is key. I will trust my divinations over intuition.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Logic is indeed the safest path. I will stick to facts and avoid emotional decisions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I value harmony, but I also want to win. I'll support the most logical choice.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
